    "audited_paths": [],
    "reason": "The defect is that the map editor's tile template list is painted in an order that does not match the tileset YAML. The templates are all present, so the shortfall exists only in the order the selector draws."
  },
  "fix_commit": "c47ebfbb52d70312c127c3c7bd3f5736b1fab164",
  "issue": {
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "assignee": null,
    "assignees": [],
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body_normalized": "## Issue Summary\n\nThe default tile of new maps created using the map editor has changed, and the positions of various templates have moved within the tile template list. It looks like they may now be sorted numerically, which was not the case before.\n\nFor example, the first template in the list and now the default tile used for new DESERT tileset RA maps is a rock tile. For SNOW, it is water. Etc. Previously, they were the appropriate clear tiles.\n\nI did a bisect which pointed to 649e7e8c280269f0ef4f30486d808eb2cb219b10\n\n## Reproduction\n\nCreate a new map within the in-game map editor.\n\nObserve that the map is pre-initialized to an inappropriate tile, and the template list is now differently ordered.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nNew maps should pre-initialize with clear tiles.\n\n## Screenshots / Screen recordings / Replays\n\n<img alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48abd5dd-d611-4392-a0d0-c9f7ba50f27b\" />",
    "body_raw": "## Issue Summary\n\nThe default tile of new maps created using the map editor has changed, and the positions of various templates have moved within the tile template list. It looks like they may now be sorted numerically, which was not the case before.\n\nFor example, the first template in the list and now the default tile used for new DESERT tileset RA maps is a rock tile. For SNOW, it is water. Etc. Previously, they were the appropriate clear tiles.\n\nI did a bisect which pointed to 649e7e8c280269f0ef4f30486d808eb2cb219b10\n\n## Reproduction\n\nCreate a new map within the in-game map editor.\n\nObserve that the map is pre-initialized to an inappropriate tile, and the template list is now differently ordered.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nNew maps should pre-initialize with clear tiles.\n\n## Screenshots / Screen recordings / Replays\n\n<img alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48abd5dd-d611-4392-a0d0-c9f7ba50f27b\" />",
